#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: debi-payment-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Debi Payment for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Debi Payment for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: debi-payment-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/debipro/debi-payment-for-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/debipro/debi-payment-for-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: debi-payment-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Official Debi payment gateway integration for WooCommerce. Accept credit "
"cards with installments and automatic debit payments."
msgstr "Integración oficial de la pasarela de pagos Debi para WooCommerce. Acepte tarjetas de crédito en cuotas y pagos por débito automático."

#. Author of the plugin
#: debi-payment-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "DEBI"
msgstr "DEBI"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: debi-payment-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/debipro"
msgstr "https://github.com/debipro"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:39 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:40
msgid "Debi Payment"
msgstr "Pago Debi"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:125
msgid "Sandbox mode is enabled; no real charges are made."
msgstr "El modo sandbox está activado; no se realizan cargos reales."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:181
msgid "The card form could not be loaded. Please refresh and try again."
msgstr ""
"El formulario de tarjeta no se pudo cargar. Por favor recargue la página e "
"intente nuevamente."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:182
msgid "The card could not be validated. Check the details and try again."
msgstr ""
"La tarjeta no pudo ser validada. Verifique los datos e intente nuevamente."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:183 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1162
#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1260
#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1419
msgid ""
"The payment service is temporarily busy. Please wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "El servicio de pagos está temporalmente ocupado. Espere un momento e intente nuevamente."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:184
msgid "The card form is not ready yet."
msgstr "El formulario de tarjeta todavía no está listo."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:185
msgid "interest-free"
msgstr "sin interés"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:186
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:187
msgid "Select the number of installments"
msgstr "Seleccione la cantidad de cuotas"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:188
msgid "Installments"
msgstr "Cuotas"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:189
msgid "Please select the number of installments."
msgstr "Por favor seleccione la cantidad de cuotas."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:190
msgid ""
"To enable this payment method, complete the linking process in the plugin "
"settings."
msgstr "Para habilitar este método de pago, complete el proceso de vinculación en la configuración del plugin."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:191 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1589
msgid "You will be redirected to Debi to complete your payment securely."
msgstr "Será redirigido a Debi para completar su pago de forma segura."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:192
#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsListTable.php:50
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:199
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Monto"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:193 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1602
msgid "Monthly amount"
msgstr "Monto mensual"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:194 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1121
#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1374
msgid "Please enter a valid amount."
msgstr "Por favor ingrese un monto válido."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:347
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activar/Desactivar"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:349
msgid "Enable Debi Payments"
msgstr "Habilitar pagos con Debi"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:353
msgid "Method Title"
msgstr "Título del método"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:355
msgid "This controls the title"
msgstr "Controla el título"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:356
msgid "Credit or debit card in installments"
msgstr "Tarjeta de crédito o débito en cuotas"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:360
msgid "Secret key"
msgstr "Clave secreta"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:363
msgid ""
"Use sk_test_… for sandbox or sk_live_… for production — the environment is "
"inferred from the prefix. Used server-side only; never exposed to the "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Use sk_test_… para sandbox o sk_live_… para producción — el entorno se "
"infiere del prefijo. Solo se usa en el servidor; nunca se expone al "
"navegador."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:366
msgid "Publishable key"
msgstr "Clave publicable"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:369
msgid ""
"Safe to expose in the browser; the checkout card element uses it "
"(pk_test_… / pk_live_…). Must match the secret key environment."
msgstr ""
"Seguro para exponer en el navegador; el elemento de tarjeta en el checkout "
"lo utiliza (pk_test_… / pk_live_…). Debe coincidir con el entorno de la "
"clave secreta."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:372
msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL del Webhook"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:376
msgid "Webhook signing secret"
msgstr "Secreto de firma del Webhook"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:379
msgid ""
"Paste the endpoint signing secret from your Debi developers dashboard. Used "
"to verify that incoming webhook events were sent by Debi."
msgstr ""
"Pegue el secreto de firma del endpoint desde el panel de desarrolladores de "
"Debi. Se usa para verificar que los eventos de webhook entrantes fueron "
"enviados por Debi."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:382
msgid "Product default values"
msgstr "Valores predeterminados del producto"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:384
msgid ""
"These apply when the product does not have its own configuration in the Debi "
"tab."
msgstr "Se aplican cuando el producto no tiene su propia configuración en la pestaña Debi."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:387
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:169
msgid "Default checkout type"
msgstr "Tipo de checkout predeterminado"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:393
msgid "Default checkout mode"
msgstr "Modo de checkout predeterminado"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:397
msgid ""
"Embedded: the card is captured on this site. Redirect: the customer is sent "
"to Debi's hosted checkout. Products can override this."
msgstr "Integrado: la tarjeta se captura en este sitio. Redirección: se envía al cliente al checkout alojado por Debi. Los productos pueden sobrescribir esta opción."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:399
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:190
msgid "Embedded"
msgstr "Integrado"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:400
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:191
msgid "Redirect"
msgstr "Redirección"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:404
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:213
msgid "Monthly interest (%)"
msgstr "Interés mensual (%)"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:410
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:229
msgid "Fixed installments"
msgstr "Cuotas fijas"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:413
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:233
msgid ""
"Fixed number of installments. Mutually exclusive with \"Maximum "
"installments\"."
msgstr "Cantidad fija de cuotas. Excluyente con «Cuotas máximas»."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:418
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:245
msgid "Maximum installments"
msgstr "Cuotas máximas"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:421
msgid ""
"The customer chooses between 1 and this value. Mutually exclusive with "
"\"Fixed installments\"."
msgstr "El cliente elige entre 1 y este valor. Excluyente con «Cuotas fijas»."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:426
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:261
msgid "Surcharge (%)"
msgstr "Recargo (%)"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:473
msgid "Test / Setup automatically"
msgstr "Probar / Configurar automáticamente"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:477
msgid ""
"Uses your secret key to create the endpoint at Debi (payment.created, "
"payment.updated, payment.retrying, payment.cancelled) if it does not exist "
"yet, updates its events if stale, and fills in the signing secret below. "
"Save changes to persist it."
msgstr "Usa su clave secreta para crear el endpoint en Debi (payment.created, payment.updated, payment.retrying, payment.cancelled) si aún no existe, actualiza sus eventos si están desactualizados y completa el secreto de firma más abajo. Guarde los cambios para conservarlo."

#. translators: 1: production dashboard link, 2: testing dashboard link.
#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:484
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site is not publicly reachable, so automatic setup is disabled. Add "
"this URL as a webhook endpoint (events: payment.created, payment.updated, "
"payment.retrying, payment.cancelled) in your Debi dashboard — Production: "
"%1$s · Testing: %2$s — then paste its signing secret below."
msgstr "Este sitio no es accesible públicamente, por lo que la configuración automática está deshabilitada. Agregue esta URL como endpoint de webhook (eventos: payment.created, payment.updated, payment.retrying, payment.cancelled) en su panel de Debi — Producción: %1$s · Pruebas: %2$s — y luego pegue su secreto de firma más abajo."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:540 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:808
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "No tiene permiso para realizar esta acción."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:544
msgid "Automatic setup is unavailable on local sites."
msgstr "La configuración automática no está disponible en sitios locales."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:552
msgid "Enter a valid secret key first (sk_test_… or sk_live_…)."
msgstr "Ingrese primero una clave secreta válida (sk_test_… o sk_live_…)."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:558
msgid "Debi rejected the request. Check the secret key and try again."
msgstr ""
"Debi rechazó la solicitud. Verifique la clave secreta e intente nuevamente."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:560
msgid "The webhook could not be set up. Please try again."
msgstr "No se pudo configurar el webhook. Por favor intente nuevamente."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:564
msgid ""
"The endpoint exists but its signing secret was not returned. Copy it from "
"the Debi dashboard."
msgstr ""
"El endpoint ya existe pero no se devolvió su secreto de firma. Cópielo desde "
"el panel de Debi."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:571
msgid "Existing webhook found; signing secret saved."
msgstr "Webhook existente encontrado; secreto de firma guardado."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:573
msgid "Webhook created and signing secret saved."
msgstr "Webhook creado y secreto de firma guardado."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:575
msgid "Existing webhook updated with payment events; signing secret saved."
msgstr "Se actualizó el webhook existente con los eventos de pago; se guardó el secreto de firma."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:682 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:978
msgid "Not configured"
msgstr "No configurado"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:684
#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsListTable.php:415
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Probar"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:689
msgid "Saved secret key:"
msgstr "Clave secreta guardada:"

#. translators: 1: production dashboard link, 2: testing dashboard link.
#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:700
#, php-format
msgid "Find your keys — Production: %1$s · Testing: %2$s"
msgstr "Encuentre sus claves — Producción: %1$s · Pruebas: %2$s"

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:776 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:1017
msgid ""
"When the default product type is Installment, set either \"Fixed "
"installments\" or \"Maximum installments\"."
msgstr "Cuando el tipo de producto predeterminado es Cuotas, defina «Cuotas fijas» o «Cuotas máximas»."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:815
msgid "Enter at least one key before testing."
msgstr "Ingrese al menos una clave antes de probar."

#: class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:835 class-debipro-payment-gateway.php:976
msgid "TEST (sandbox)"
msgstr "TEST (sandbox)"

