"Cancel subscription %s in Debi? This stops all future charges and cannot be "
"undone from here."
msgstr "¿Cancelar la suscripción %s en Debi? Esto detiene todos los cargos futuros y no se puede deshacer desde aquí."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:239
msgid "Yes, cancel in Debi"
msgstr "Sí, cancelar en Debi"

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:240
msgid "No, go back"
msgstr "No, volver"

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:257
msgid "Subscription reconciled from Debi."
msgstr "Suscripción reconciliada desde Debi."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:258
msgid "Subscription cancelled in Debi."
msgstr "Suscripción cancelada en Debi."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:261
msgid "No subscription was specified."
msgstr "No se especificó ninguna suscripción."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:262
msgid "Debi is not configured on this store (check the gateway API keys)."
msgstr "Debi no está configurado en esta tienda (verifique las claves API de la pasarela)."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:263
msgid "Could not fetch the subscription from Debi. Please try again."
msgstr "No se pudo obtener la suscripción desde Debi. Por favor intente nuevamente."

#: includes/Admin/SubscriptionsPage.php:264
msgid "Could not cancel the subscription in Debi. Please try again."
msgstr "No se pudo cancelar la suscripción en Debi. Por favor intente nuevamente."

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:109 includes/class-debipro-cart.php:122
msgid "Authorization only — no charge"
msgstr "Solo autorización — sin cargo"

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:139
msgid "Adhesion"
msgstr "Adhesión"

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:140
msgid ""
"We only register your payment method for future debits. No payment is taken "
"now."
msgstr "Solo registramos su método de pago para débitos futuros. No se realiza ningún cobro ahora."

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:253
msgid ""
"The cart already contains an installment product. You cannot add more "
"products."
msgstr "El carrito ya contiene un producto en cuotas. No puede agregar más productos."

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:257
msgid ""
"You cannot add an installment product together with other products. Please "
"empty the cart first."
msgstr "No puede agregar un producto en cuotas junto con otros productos. Por favor vacíe el carrito primero."

#: includes/class-debipro-cart.php:260
msgid ""
"These products cannot be purchased together. Please empty the cart first."
msgstr "Estos productos no se pueden comprar juntos. Por favor vacíe el carrito primero."

#: includes/class-debipro-keys.php:91
msgid ""
"The Secret key must start with sk_test_ or sk_live_. It looks like you "
"pasted a publishable (pk_) key."
msgstr ""
"La clave secreta debe comenzar con sk_test_ o sk_live_. Parece que pegó una "
"clave publicable (pk_)."

#: includes/class-debipro-keys.php:94
msgid ""
"The Secret key environment could not be determined. Use a key starting with "
"sk_test_ (sandbox) or sk_live_ (production)."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo determinar el entorno de la clave secreta. Use una clave que "
"comience con sk_test_ (sandbox) o sk_live_ (producción)."

#: includes/class-debipro-keys.php:100
msgid ""
"The Publishable key must start with pk_test_ or pk_live_. Never paste your "
"secret (sk_) key here."
msgstr ""
"La clave publicable debe comenzar con pk_test_ o pk_live_. Nunca pegue aquí "
"su clave secreta (sk_)."

#: includes/class-debipro-keys.php:103
msgid ""
"The Publishable key environment could not be determined. Use a key starting "
"with pk_test_ (sandbox) or pk_live_ (production)."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo determinar el entorno de la clave publicable. Use una clave que "
"comience con pk_test_ (sandbox) o pk_live_ (producción)."

#: includes/class-debipro-keys.php:108
msgid ""
"The Secret and Publishable keys belong to different environments (test vs "
"live). Use a matching pair."
msgstr ""
"La clave secreta y la clave publicable pertenecen a entornos distintos (test "
"vs live). Use un par que coincida."

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:44
msgid "Debi"
msgstr "Debi"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:58
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Pago"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:59
msgid "Installment"
msgstr "Cuotas"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:61
msgid "Mandate"
msgstr "Mandato"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:172
msgid ""
"The Debi session this product opens by default. Payment: a single charge "
"(optionally split into installments). Subscription: a recurring charge. "
"Mandate: capture a payment method for later charges."
msgstr "La sesión de Debi que abre este producto por defecto. Pago: un único cargo (opcionalmente dividido en cuotas). Suscripción: un cargo recurrente. Mandato: captura un método de pago para cargos posteriores."

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:180
msgid "Checkout mode"
msgstr "Modo de checkout"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:183
msgid ""
"Embedded: the card is captured on this site. Redirect: the customer is sent "
"to Debi's hosted checkout. Empty = use the plugin default."
msgstr "Integrado: la tarjeta se captura en este sitio. Redirección: se envía al cliente al checkout alojado por Debi. Vacío = usar el valor predeterminado del plugin."

#. translators: %s: the plugin-level default checkout mode.
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:187
#, php-format
msgid "Use default (%s)"
msgstr "Usar predeterminado (%s)"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:202
msgid ""
"Fixed: the product price is charged. Customer-defined: the buyer sets the "
"amount (useful for donations and free-amount subscriptions)."
msgstr "Fijo: se cobra el precio del producto. Definido por el cliente: el comprador establece el monto (útil para donaciones y suscripciones de monto libre)."

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:204
msgid "Fixed amount"
msgstr "Monto fijo"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:205
msgid "Customer-defined amount"
msgstr "Monto definido por el cliente"

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:217
#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:265
msgid "Empty = use the plugin's default value."
msgstr "Vacío = usar el valor predeterminado del plugin."

#: includes/class-debipro-product-meta.php:249
msgid ""
"The customer freely chooses between 1 and this value. Mutually exclusive "
"with \"Fixed installments\"."
msgstr "El cliente elige libremente entre 1 y este valor. Excluyente con «Cuotas fijas»."

